00:58:20.010 --> 00:58:28.810
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our program by Mr. Torey Malatia, who explains why it is so hard getting objective journalism on to the public radio station that he manages.
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ对我们节目的管理监管，由托里·马拉蒂亚先生负责。他解释了为什么在他管理的公共广播电台上进行客观报道如此困难。

00:58:28.810 --> 00:58:34.560
<v Hyder Akbar>Professional people here are the communists that were trained by the Russians.
<v Hyder Akbar>这里的专业人士是受过俄国人训练的共产主义者。

00:58:34.560 --> 00:58:54.410
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。

